---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Rural Development Program" description="Sarvagun Society's rural development work — building water reservoirs and pipelines for villages in Uttarakhand.">
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--spacing-page)] px-4 lg:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Rural Development Program</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-muted space-y-4">
        <p>After receiving a request from a village member of <strong>Bhitarli</strong>, Sarvagun Society's members went to visit the village, where they saw the miserable conditions of sanitation and water supply.</p>

        <p>The village was not having an adequate water supply and the whole village was dependent upon a single natural water resource. The society constructed a <strong>new water reservoir</strong> so that the water coming from natural resources could be collected, stored, and used by villagers for daily purposes and irrigation.</p>

        <p>All the young men and women in the village contributed their voluntary service for construction of the water reservoir.</p>

        <p>The primary school of the village was not having a source for water supply in the school, so the society fitted and brought a <strong>74-meter pipeline</strong> from the village to reach the school in order to overcome the water supply shortage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
